\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {19}{\ignorespaces The methods of the repair experiment (Section~\ref {sec:e3u_repair}). Each row is one method. \emph  {Decides with}: the sets that a request must satisfy to be admitted unchanged (``safe set'': its field lies in the safe set; ``two sets'': in the safe set and outside the unsafe set). \emph  {Stops when the mixture is}: the conditions that the deployed field must meet; the bisection looks for the smallest mixing weight that meets them. \emph  {Weights}: those of the sets, static (uniform) or the nearest prompt of each class (XN:1), with $M=140$ anchors of each class. Every method chooses as target the approved prompt nearest to the request in the field distance among those whose field meets its stop conditions. The first two rows are the methods of Section~\ref {sec:e3_combined}, rerun on this split; $\tau $ is the median distance between a safe calibration prompt and its nearest safe anchor in the field distance, the local stop of that section.}}{58}{table.caption.119}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:e3u_methods}{{19}{58}{The methods of the repair experiment (Section~\ref {sec:e3u_repair}). Each row is one method. \emph {Decides with}: the sets that a request must satisfy to be admitted unchanged (``safe set'': its field lies in the safe set; ``two sets'': in the safe set and outside the unsafe set). \emph {Stops when the mixture is}: the conditions that the deployed field must meet; the bisection looks for the smallest mixing weight that meets them. \emph {Weights}: those of the sets, static (uniform) or the nearest prompt of each class (XN:1), with $M=140$ anchors of each class. Every method chooses as target the approved prompt nearest to the request in the field distance among those whose field meets its stop conditions. The first two rows are the methods of Section~\ref {sec:e3_combined}, rerun on this split; $\tau $ is the median distance between a safe calibration prompt and its nearest safe anchor in the field distance, the local stop of that section}{table.caption.119}{}}
